## License Overview
The **DPUF (Dual-Precision Unified Format)** container specification, Zero-Decode AVX2/FMA/OpenMP C inference engine (`dpuf_engine.c`, `dpuf_avx2.c`, `dpuf-cli`), and associated profiling/quantization tools are licensed under a **Dual Community & Enterprise Commercial License**:

1. **Free for Academic, Research & Personal Local Use (Unlimited):**
   - Free forever for universities, students, individual researchers, non-profit academic research, and personal hobbyist evaluation on local hardware.
2. **Commercial & Platform Licensing Required:**
   - Any commercial entity, funded startup, or enterprise that monetizes, deploys in proprietary production systems, serves through paid commercial APIs, or embeds DPUF and its execution mechanics into a commercial platform/application (including but not limited to distribution via multi-model serving platforms, model execution runners, or cloud-hosted AI inference providers) **must obtain a written Commercial Enterprise License from the author (D. P. / dule_pan) prior to distribution or commercial use**.

